										<h4>Bio</h4>
										<p>
											Della’s design philosophy centers on narrative-driven interactive interfaces and functional minimalism. After mastering visual communications and front-end craftsmanship, she went on to pioneer modern digital experiences that seamlessly blend sleek web performance with tactile, human-centric design.
										</p>
									</div>
									<div class="v1-2-medium">
										<h4>1992 -</h4>
										<p>
											Phan has established herself as a key creative voice across digital design networks, leading global UI/UX initiatives and building design systems for forward-thinking brands. Today, she continues her work from Vancouver, experimenting with motion physics, dynamic grid layouts, and digital storytelling.
										</p>
